["Fractional: items divisible ⇒ greedy by v/w ratio is optimal.","0/1 knapsack: items indivisible ⇒ greedy may fail (use DP).","Steps: compute ratios, sort descending, fill.","Time O(n log n) due to sorting.","Example 0/1 optimum for above is 220 (items 2+3), greedy 0/1 would give 160.","Takes whole items first and a fraction of the last."],
